{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項最新研究顯示，在應對洪水侵襲時，一卷價格不足10英鎊的普通膠帶，或許能夠提供比傳統沙袋更有效的入户防洪保護。研究人員通過實驗發現，正確地在房門外側使用膠帶密封縫隙，可將滲水量減少97%至98%，顯著降低洪水進入住宅的風險。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583448.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T22:39:59.892957+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:20:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_hash":"e54de2b2e2105cb2afb8df4a7e53ecfa6f0d1842d48bfa64c6164d8b8af884f6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}